+| **Librarian** | Docs/code search | Lightweight | MiniMax M2.5 → Gemini 3 Flash → Big Pickle |
+| **Multimodal Looker** | Vision/screenshots | Kimi/multimodal | Kimi K2.5 → Gemini 3 Flash → GPT-5.2 → GLM-4.6v |
